{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15104490","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15104490","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1510449001:0":{"text":"When I look at what they drew on the ground, it makes me queasy...","source_cn":"地上的图案，看着让人不舒服……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10874CC8399DCE93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510449002:0":{"text":"Perseus, can these outsiders really make Halia better?","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，这些外来的魔法师真的能让呼临变好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2577E1FD3E90912B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510449003:0":{"text":"I trust them and the Regulus has agreed to let them try.","source_cn":"我相信他们。领主大人也同意让他们一试。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x228B6E8FEBBA0ABF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510449004:0":{"text":"... That's good to know.","source_cn":"哦……哦……那我们就放心了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD9B4DB00DFA09BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510449005:0":{"text":"May the God of Harvest bless us and bring forth the rain again. We're almost out of food...","source_cn":"丰饶神大人保佑，希望能早些下雨，粮食实在不多了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AE373B16549A0B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510449006:1":{"text":"I know. Just hold on a little longer.","source_cn":"我知道。再忍一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC70B93C046034A07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510449007:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, this magic circle was drawn by one of our artisans. Do you think it'll suffice?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE03B9279319EDC44","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, this magic circle was drawn by one of our artisans. Do you think it'll suffice?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, this magic circle was drawn by one of our artisans. Do you think it'll suffice?","variant_male_record_index":"180569","variant_female_record_index":"180570","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510449008:0":{"text":"Your eyes trace the crude markings on the ground. It looks like the work of someone who paints walls for a living, not magic circles.","source_cn":"你低头看了一眼地上的图形，只能说有个大概的样子，让人怀...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6901C220628E6874","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Your eyes trace the crude markings on the ground. It looks like the work of someone who paints walls for a living, not magic circles.","female":"Your eyes trace the crude markings on the ground. It looks like the work of someone who paints walls for a living, not magic circles.","variant_male_record_index":"180571","variant_female_re